S3AFUEL V1.7 - README
------------------

This file is for users of V1.6 who wish to upgrade to V1.7  New users should use the full instructions.

To upgrade from V1.6:

1.    Replace the old S3AFUEL6.APP file with the new S3AFUEL7.APP.

2.    If you are using the optional On-Line Help (Highly recommended) replace the file S3AFUELH.OVL in the \APP\S3AFUEL\ directory.

3.    If you are using the optional Print option replace the file S3AFUELP.OVL in the \APP\S3AFUEL\ directory.

The following enhancement has been added.  (Forgot to put it into V1.6)

You can now set a reminder for Oil Changes/Servicing or anything else which is date/distance based.  The program will look at your normal use, and then warn you just before either the date or the mileage is due.  it will then tell you again when you have missed it !!

Also, the Statistics screen has been greatly expanded.

The consumption averaging now works properly (I hope)

Hope you like the improvements.

Al
